{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日発売だった\n週刊ヤングマガジンさんに\nじょしらく チームく\nのメンバーが載ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/16/8597350/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなそれぞれ\n役のカラーの和装で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても綺麗な幻想的な感じに\n撮っていただきました！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/16/8597350/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小嶋陽菜さんが表紙なのが目印です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェックしてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/16/8597350/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょしらく頑張るぞー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天クイズin台湾\n後半戦もあがりましたー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てね！よろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/16/8597350/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://video.rakuten.co.jp/content/131344/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔や首や脚や腕が\n蚊に刺されてたのですが\nようやくひいてきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔と首は\n寝てる間にやられたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蚊め！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はいい眠りにつきます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}